*00200

JMS TREAD
HLT

TREAD, 0
    CLA CLL
    TAD ZPBASE
    DCA TPTR
    CLA
    DCA TCOUNT
    DCA TSTATE
    TREAD_LOOP, JMS GETCHR
    SNA
    JMP TREAD_DONE
    TAD M40
    SNA
    JMP TREAD_DELIM
    JMP TREAD_LOOP
    TREAD_DELIM, CLA
    DCA TSTATE
    JMP TREAD_LOOP
    TREAD_DONE,
    JMP I TREAD
M40, 07740
TPTR, 0
TCOUNT, 0
TSTATE, 0

ZPBASE, 00160

/ read a single character from the keyboard (TTY)
/ Input: none
/ Output: AC contains character read
/ Preserves: none (clobbers AC)
GETCHR, 0
    GETCHR_WAIT, IOT 06031
    JMP GETCHR_WAIT
    IOT 06036
    JMP I GETCHR



/ is this a valid octal digit?
/ Input: AC contains character
/ Output: AC=0 if valid octal digit (0-7), AC≠0 if not
/ Preserves: none (clobbers AC)
ISOCT, 0
TAD NEG_060
SMA
JMP ISOCT_CHK8
CLA CMA
JMP I ISOCT
ISOCT_CHK8,
TAD NEG_010
SPA
JMP ISOCT_VALID
CLA CMA
JMP I ISOCT
ISOCT_VALID,
CLA
JMP I ISOCT

NEG_060, 7720
NEG_010, 7770

/ is this A-Za-z?
/ Input: AC contains character
/ Output: AC=0 if alphabetic (A-Z or a-z), AC≠0 if not
/ Preserves: none (clobbers AC)
ISALPHA, 0
AND K0337
TAD NEG_101
SMA
JMP ISALPHA_CHKZ
CLA CMA
JMP I ISALPHA
ISALPHA_CHKZ,
TAD NEG_032
SPA
JMP ISALPHA_VALID
CLA CMA
JMP I ISALPHA
ISALPHA_VALID,
CLA
JMP I ISALPHA

K0337, 0337
NEG_101, 7677
NEG_032, 7746
